In conclusion, our consortium proposes a comprehensive solution that addresses the CHRB's needs for an AI assistance tool, ensuring strict compliance with regulatory requirements while improving efficiency and quality of care. We are committed to delivering a high-quality solution that meets the client's budget constraints, reduces the environmental footprint of their information systems, and supports their sustainable development policy.
